    <string name="terms_body">Last updated: October 2026\n\n1. Use of the service\nCafeEnLinea lets you browse the cafeteria menu and build an order within the platform. Using the app means you accept these terms.\n\n2. Orders\nPrices shown may change without notice. Product availability depends on the cafeteria\'s inventory at the time the order is confirmed.\n\n3. User account\nYou are responsible for keeping your username and password confidential, and for all activity carried out from your account.\n\n4. Privacy\nThe information you provide (name, username) is used only to identify you within the app and manage your orders.\n\n5. Support\nFor questions, complaints or clarifications, you can contact us from the Support section in your profile.\n\n6. Changes to these terms\nThese terms may be updated periodically. We will notify you of relevant changes within the app.</string>

    <string name="privacy_body">Last updated: October 2026\n\n1. Data controller\nCafeEnLinea, as part of an academic project, is responsible for the use of the personal data collected through this app.\n\n2. Data we collect\nWhen you use the app we collect: your username, and the orders you place within the platform (products, quantities and totals).\n\n3. Purpose\nYour data is used only to identify you within the app, manage your session and show your order history.\n\n4. We don\'t share your information\nYour data is not sold, rented or shared with third parties outside this project.\n\n5. Storage\nYour session is stored locally on your device so you don\'t have to sign in every time you open the app.\n\n6. Your rights\nYou can sign out at any time from the Profile section, which deletes the session saved on this device.\n\n7. Contact\nFor questions about how your data is handled, you can write to us from the Support section in your profile.</string>

